  "goodToKnow": "Botanisch means botanical: der Botanische Garten, botanische Namen. Berlin-Dahlem's Botanischer Garten is one of the largest in the world. Die Botanik is botany, and der Botaniker a botanist. German naturalist Alexander von Humboldt's botanical expeditions in Latin America shaped modern ecology. Colloquially, ab in die Botanik means off into the wild, the bushes."
